@host = http://localhost:8080
@password = DemoPass!2026
@restaurant = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000301
@item = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000401

### Customer token (copy accessToken into the variables below)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"customer1@demo.local","password":"{{password}}"}

### Owner token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"owner1@demo.local","password":"{{password}}"}

### Delivery-partner token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"partner1@demo.local","password":"{{password}}"}

### Browse the seeded restaurant catalog
GET {{host}}/api/restaurants
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Browse the seeded menu
GET {{host}}/api/restaurants/{{restaurant}}/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Add stock-backed demo item to the cart
PUT {{host}}/api/cart/items/{{item}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity":2}

### Inspect cart and take its version for checkout
GET {{host}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Place an order. Replace cartVersion with the GET /api/cart version.
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-checkout-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"paymentMethod":"UPI","addressLine1":"42 Demo Lane","city":"Pune","state":"Maharashtra","country":"India","cartVersion":1}
